{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in a first-person experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a Chinese-themed amusement park shrouded in the eerie nostalgia of the millennium. Here, fading festivity intertwines with lurking dread. Through detailed environmental interaction, surveillance monitoring, and document analysis, you will live through a nightmare that steadily erodes your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dual Responsibilities: Day and Night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your work is split into two interconnected shifts that drive the game\u2019s progression:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day Shift: Ticket Inspection</strong><br>Verify visitors\u2019 identities and tickets at the entrance booth. Follow the ever-changing <i>Park Entry Guidelines</i> to decide whom to admit or turn away. But beware\u2014the rules themselves may be contradictory, and your choices will set the stage for the night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night Patrol</strong><br>When darkness falls, the park\u2019s atmosphere shifts entirely. Using static-filled surveillance screens, you must monitor the grounds and venture out personally to handle supernatural phenomena triggered by your daytime decisions.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4069670?t=1761881220","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069670/d9c89ec00eeb36a0805310a9e798a070ec13c350/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761881220","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069670/1a942ca85b85a9ee837e73602ca746c32a4ede75/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761881220","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069670/1a942ca85b85a9ee837e73602ca746c32a4ede75/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761881220","categories":[{"description":"S